detail.longDescription:
Lagom is a fast and secure VPN proxy for everyday internet use. Connect in one tap, protect your connection on Wi-Fi and mobile networks, and keep using your favorite apps, streaming services, games, social networks and messengers without complicated setup.

The app is built for people who need a simple VPN that works every day: stable speed, private connection, modern VPN protocols and a clean interface without distracting screens.

What you get with Lagom:
• fast VPN proxy for streaming, games, apps, social networks and messengers;
• secure connection on Wi-Fi and mobile networks;
• free plan with a renewable data limit;
• no ads inside the app;
• no trackers and no activity logs;
• modern VLESS and V2Ray protocols;
• AES-256 traffic encryption;
• Kill Switch to help protect your connection if VPN drops;
• Split Tunneling to choose which apps use VPN;
• automatic route switching;
• one account for your devices;
• Pro features for active daily VPN use.

Fast VPN proxy for daily use
Lagom helps you keep a stable private connection at home, at work, in a hotel, in a cafe, while traveling or on public Wi-Fi. Open the app, choose a server and turn on VPN in seconds. No long setup, no overloaded interface, no unnecessary steps.

Security and privacy
VPN connection encrypts internet traffic between your device and the VPN server. This helps protect your data on open networks and makes everyday browsing more private. Lagom does not show ads inside the app, does not use trackers and does not keep activity logs.

Flexible connection settings
Use Split Tunneling when only selected apps should work through VPN. Enable Kill Switch for extra protection if the VPN connection is interrupted. Lagom also supports automatic route switching, so the app can choose a better route when needed.

Free start and Pro access
Start with a free plan that includes a renewable data limit. If you need more traffic and advanced features, upgrade to Pro for active daily use.

Lagom is a fast and secure VPN proxy for people who want speed, privacy, stable connection and a simple app without ads.
